          4 OK         5 Session context                                            EXIT CRITERION: a DIFFERENT profile on the same connection raises E-50022 and changes nothing                                                                                                            Error 50022, expected 50022. UserProfileId after the refusal: 2, expected 2 -- the FIRST profile, unchanged. This is UI-06 for the application: a connection serves one profile, so a request that switches profile must take a new connection or the pool must reset. This connection already carries session context for UserId 8 / UserProfileId 2, and this token resolves to UserId 8 / UserProfileId 3. The keys are read-only for the life of a connection and cannot be replaced (error 15664), which is deliberate: it is what stops a later statement -- injected or merely careless -- changing the acting identity mid-request. ONE CONNECTION MAY NOT SERVE TWO PROFILES (section 14.3, UI-06): a background job iterating over profiles must close and reopen, or use a conne                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
